      "content": "that's a good start for the vibe, but it's a bit abstract. i need to really see the scene. can you add some detail about the people walking around or hanging out on the corners? like, what do the people in this neighborhood actually look like? i want to be able to picture the specific types of people you'd see in those news reports about crime—the ones that make you keep your head down and walk faster.",
